    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18877" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frūmen</span></b> , ĭnis,
			n.
		fruor (post-class.). * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A gruel</i> or <i>porridge made of
				corn</i>, <i>and used in sacrifices</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Arn. 7,
			230</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάρυγξ</span>, <i>the
				larynx</i>, <i>throat</i>, Don. <i><span class="en">Ter. Phorm.
				2, 2, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Ad. 5, 8, 27</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Serv. Verg. G. 1, 74</span></i>, and A.
			1, 178; <i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 17, 3, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">6,
				23</span></i>; <i><span class="en">20, 2, 27</span></i>.</div>
